  "title": "Starlit Roamer",
  "date": "2025-03-05",
  "excerpt": "The Starlit Roamer is a fully custom Mercedes Sprinter 170 AWD camper van built for those who seek adventure without sacrificing comfort. Designed on the El Capitan build tier, this van is equipped for off-grid living wi",
  "body": [
    "The Starlit Roamer is a fully custom Mercedes Sprinter 170 AWD camper van built for those who seek adventure without sacrificing comfort. Designed on the El Capitan build tier, this van is equipped for off-grid living with an 800Ah lithium iron phosphate battery, a 3000W pure sine wave inverter, and a 300W solar system. With multiple 110V outlets, USB-A and USB-C ports, and shore power connectivity, it provides the reliability needed for extended road trips and remote work.",
    "Climate control is optimized with a premium insulation package, a 12V Nomadic air conditioning unit, a Maxxair Deluxe ceiling fan, and a diesel-powered Espar heater. The SCA pop top adds versatility, creating additional sleeping or lounging space while maintaining a compact footprint. Interior aesthetics feature painted shiplap siding, a wood-stained ceiling, recessed dimmable LED lighting, and durable wood-style vinyl flooring, giving the space a modern yet cozy feel.",
    "The kitchen is designed for convenience with an acacia butcher block countertop, an in-counter double burner induction cooktop, an Isotherm Cruise 130 refrigerator with a freezer, and an undermount stainless steel sink. Storage is maximized with five overhead cabinets, a floor-to-ceiling closet with shelves and a hanging rod, and a custom bench seat with internal storage. A pull-out trash can system and multiple under-counter drawers add to the functionality, keeping essentials organized and easily accessible.",
    "This adventure-ready camper van is equipped with all-terrain wheels and tires, an Owl Vans B2 bike carrier, a Lost Saguaro tire carrier, and an expedition box for extra gear storage. AMP power retracting steps provide easy entry and exit, while a Weboost cell signal booster ensures connectivity in remote locations. A VIZIO 24-inch TV with a swivel mount adds entertainment on the road, making this van as comfortable as it is capable.",
    "The Starlit Roamer was designed for those who want to explore the open road with confidence. If you’re looking for a fully customized camper van built for adventure, reach out today to start designing your own build."
  ],
